I've updated my "Ranger Species Ally/Enemy" patch to version rse02a.
http://www.jcatena.net/nethack/patches.shtml#rse

I added several messages to give a general idea of what's going on,
when you come in contact with an enemy or an ally.

This patch has additional data in the player structure, so it is
incompatible with vanilla save and bones files (sorry).

Please let me know how it works for you, and please post anything
entertaining that happens as a result of this patch. Also, please let
me know if you feel you get a wildly inappropriate enemy or ally.


DETAILS SPOILER:

Attacking allies now results in an alignment change for lawful
rangers.  They're still peaceful.

Several changes for enemies.  They start hostile, and still can't be
tamed.  The ranger better hits and damages them, and better avoids
their attacks.

